Title: "Writing"
Id: "801f1204-3579-4100-9373-e22f3912657e"

Text: "```mlg-fragment
Writing:
. <name> :~> <latex>
```

A collection may contain at most one top-level `Writing:` item. The left-hand
side of each alias must be a name. The renderer uses these aliases when rendering
names throughout expressions, statements, and specifications."
Id: "6d284986-b912-4519-b5d4-316e2783e35d"
